  (text "C (9xx) — EXTERNAL POWER INPUT, FIELD-CYCLING H-BRIDGE, POLARIZER SWITCH" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.7 14 0) (effects (font (size 3 3) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "7b3a8a48-82de-5280-b7aa-fe19827801ca"))
  (text "Input (7): J901 -> F901 5 A fast (0466005.NRHF) -> D931 SMBJ26A (26 V standoff > the 24 V maximum input; the fuse limits the TVS fault current) -> Q901 AOD4185 reverse-polarity P-FET (15 mOhm: 0.375 W at 5 A against 2.75 W for a Schottky) -> +VEXT." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.7 19 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "edbc137b-c2df-5912-8ef9-7ddb67e0c065"))
  (text "D932 BZX84C12 clamps V_GS of Q901 (AOD4185 maximum +-20 V); R940 enhances the P-FET. C940 + C941 are the +VEXT bulk; D933/R941 show the rail. Loads on +VEXT: OPA564 V+ (NMR TX), DRV8871 VM, UCC27517 VDD. Nothing else." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.7 22.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "57aa182e-028d-51af-9722-bba9f23f7910"))
  (text "H-bridge (5): U903 DRV8871, VM = +VEXT. C921 100 uF is sized for the 25 us internal t_OFF window (C = I dt / dV = 2 A x 25 us / 0.5 V); C920 100 nF at the pin. R920 sets I_TRIP = 64 / R_ILIM(kOhm); 1 % because the trip point is directly proportional to it. R921/R922 hold IN1/IN2 low at reset = coast." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.7 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "14b32f2b-e39d-5f15-842f-5b396ac0d0fd"))
  (text "D920 SMBJ26A sits VM -> GND, NOT across the coil: the bridge has integral body diodes, so the coil freewheels inside the part and the only real risk is supply pumping (1/2 L I^2 = 1.8 mJ into 100 uF from 15 V = 1.2 V rise). The clamp must fire below the DRV8871's 45 V maximum, which is why the brief's SMBJ58A is wrong here." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.7 28.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "8212028d-b8b9-5ab4-9c53-db3a06b97678"))
  (text "Polarizer (6): FET_GATE -> R930 pull-down + R931 damping -> U904 UCC27517 (4 A driver) -> R932 -> Q904 AOD4184A (40 V, 13 A, 7 mOhm). JP904 picks the driver supply: +VEXT (default, V_GS = 12-18 V, R_DS(on) at its 10 V spec point) or +5V_RAW." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.7 31.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "79d7060a-7c99-55fe-b75d-5691c3d79bda"))
  (text "Flyback (6.1), one footprint set, three stuffing options: (a) D930 SS54 freewheel, tau = L/R = 2.6 ms — fitted by default; (b) the RC snubber (the Michal route, 2.2 R 5 W + 4700 uF 50 V) over-damped at ~10 ms, +VCOIL <= 24 V — wired EXTERNALLY across J905 pins 1-2, the parts are too big for the board; (c) D934 SMBJ20A fast dump, 591 us, +VCOIL <= 12 V. This board does the ADIABATIC transfer, not the sudden one." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.7 35 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "d5b4c3d0-1631-5969-9abb-5154a43a3f56"))
  (text "R933 is the optional 10 mOhm Kelvin shunt in the source return (13.4 A x 10 mOhm = 134 mV = 5 % of the ADS8688 +-2.56 V range, so no divider) brought out as ISENSE_COIL for a spare ADC channel. It is fitted as a 0 R link by default so the source return is never open." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.7 38.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "bd9ea105-6db1-530f-8bde-78860d23b58a"))
  (text "Everything on this sheet is on GND (grounding note 8.1/8.2): up to 13 A of polarizer return must never touch the AGND pour. Route the coil pairs tight — TX out and return together, loop area under 1 cm2." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.7 41.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "863124fb-6c82-5a5e-86d5-99ab14460826"))
  (text "EXTERNAL POWER INPUT (design 7): J901 -> F901 -> D931 -> Q901 -> +VEXT" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 30 50 0) (effects (font (size 2 2) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "1cb02c92-7adc-53ee-9ebf-0038d64014dc"))
  (text "D932 clamps V_GS to 12 V (AOD4185 maximum +-20 V); R940 enhances the P-FET" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 89.25 110.9 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "3ac51bcd-1e64-59c3-8e93-eedd26e6f920"))
  (text "+VEXT rail LED: (24 - 2) / 4.7k = 4.7 mA at 24 V, 1.1 mA at 7 V" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 138.11 116.36 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "49ce3a1f-bcb4-5fc0-86d7-f14bf6d1b530"))
  (text "SILKSCREEN at J901:  +VEXT 7-18 V  (24 V only with U802 not fitted — the OPA564 absolute maximum supply is 26 V)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 30 118 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "1a827f03-507a-5fbd-a9bc-ee891df9996f"))
  (text "FIELD-CYCLING H-BRIDGE (design 5): DRV8871, VM = +VEXT" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 208 50 0) (effects (font (size 2 2) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "88b31d24-068b-525a-8e16-871a0661c79a"))
  (text "C921 100 uF: 2 A x 25 us / 0.5 V. D920 clamps VM below the 45 V maximum (SMBJ58A would not)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 231.78 95.66 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "53babc6b-1675-51cf-b240-de1f3ece491e"))
  (text "I_TRIP(A) = 64 / R_ILIM(kOhm)  —  32.0 k = 2.0 A (default), 17.8 k = 3.6 A, 15 k minimum" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 227.78 126.14 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "08761d24-e4de-5e4b-819e-b054ead3caf1"))
  (text "J903: 1 = OUT1, 2 = OUT2 (field-cycling coil, <= 3.6 A peak)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 298.42 87.63 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "546bc66b-ee6f-590c-8763-8dcf5f2edf9c"))
  (text "PowerPAD (pad 9 = EP): 3 x 3 array of 0.3 mm vias on a 1.0 mm grid to the bottom GND plane (datasheet 10.1); OUT traces >= 2 mm." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 211.78 130.33 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "8a54284b-476e-50fe-bbeb-e531a3de742a"))
  (text "POLARIZER MOSFET SWITCH (design 6 / 6.1): UCC27517 -> AOD4184A, three flyback options" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 30 154 0) (effects (font (size 2 2) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "3ebe4cce-9878-59f2-94ba-1188927d9492"))
  (text "JP904 default = pins 1-2 bridged: VDD = +VEXT (V_GS 12-18 V). Cut and bridge 2-3 for +5V_RAW." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 125.86 175.26 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "7fc7e8fa-4404-5901-8111-9e8c95790059"))
  (text "R930 keeps the polarizer off unless driven; R931 damps the edge into the driver input." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 97.92 235.36 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "f2c9c86a-af87-51c5-aacf-47e516748d5a"))
  (text "Option (b), the RC snubber, is OFF-BOARD: 2.2 R 5 W in series with 4700 uF 50 V, wired externally" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 218.44 185.42 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "99c21edd-0a3f-515f-b4b4-53ca4bbc70c1"))
  (text "across J905 pins 1-2 (drain to +VCOIL). The 31 x 10 mm resistor and the 22 mm capacitor do not fit" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 218.44 189.26 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "0451035d-d66b-531a-9c47-9ce5f7481f72"))
  (text "on the board (a scan of the whole outline finds no free 22.5 x 22.5 mm square outside this strip)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 218.44 193.06 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "70f2be75-e3b1-5a4d-af11-07f0133d0421"))
  (text "J905: 1 = +VCOIL (external supply +), 2 = COIL (drain), 3 = GND — the coil goes between 1 and 2." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 230.32 151.13 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "89b5d2ec-9307-5329-b517-dcb4af80ec7a"))
  (text "R933 is FITTED as a 0 R 2512 link (it is the polarizer source return and must never be open)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 168.12 237.52 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "58fd12bd-b901-5466-8c35-3d3a7e26db25"))
  (text "Swap it for the 10 mOhm shunt (1.8 W at 13.4 A, 134 mV = 5 % of the ADS8688 +-2.56 V range) to use ISENSE_COIL." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 168.12 241.52 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "8a7681a5-ca85-5d92-ba03-95df9d80a2ae"))
  (text "Flyback stuffing options on one footprint set (design 6.1) — fit ONE; the FET is a 40 V part." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 32 230 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "15ffe433-54ed-52fe-bfc1-dea3f03730a4"))
